beeps, waves, status text and scanning will be added live in the game.\nBottom-right launch: remove all FIVE large aircraft in the foreground and all their thrusters. Remove small parked jets too. Reconstruct blue ocean underneath. Keep HQ/coast and open foreground so the game can launch the EXACT ships from Image 2. Do not redraw any ship.\nDeliver the same four environments fully restored underneath the removed elements. Do not add aircraft, boats, labels or character designs. Sharp authored pixel clusters; avoid blurred digital painting."
